Description: download archive files linked from a web page
 zipgetter fetches a web page, finds every link to a .zip file (or to other
 archive types, such as .rar, .7z or .tar.gz) and downloads them all into a
 directory, showing per-file and overall progress.
 .
 Pages that build their link lists with JavaScript can be rendered first
 with a headless Chromium, Brave or Google Chrome driven by Selenium. That
 mode needs the suggested python3-selenium package, a Chrome-family browser
 and a matching chromedriver.
